sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MD as market_data
    participant TA as tad
    participant FC as forecast
    participant FD as feeds (OI)
    participant M as Model
    participant RK as Risk
    participant BK as Book
    MD->>TA: klines (1m)
    MD->>FC: klines (15m)
    MD->>FD: OI / depth / taker
    TA->>M: intel.ta (signal votes)
    FC->>M: intel.forecast (prob + move)
    FD->>M: features.json (OI quadrant)
    M->>M: rule scores the symbol
    M->>RK: risk.allow(...)
    RK-->>M: allowed
    M->>BK: open position
    BK->>MD: model.decision / model.fill
